AymnEDU — Alembic Migration Guide
===================================

## Fresh install (new PostgreSQL database)

```bash
cd backend
# Activate your virtual environment first
alembic upgrade head
```

This will run ALL migrations in order:
  1. 0001_initial_schema  → creates all tables + enums
  2. 03dd511366e5         → idempotent: adds soft-delete columns / unique constraints
                            if not already present

## Migration chain

  (base) → 0001_initial_schema → 03dd511366e5 (head)

## Add a new migration

```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe_your_change"
```

## Rollback one step

```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```